{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/8e93ca60da0ed86bc1e9c9c8e8d8c643.poster.avif?t=1765566654\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/8e93ca60da0ed86bc1e9c9c8e8d8c643.webm?t=1765566654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/8e93ca60da0ed86bc1e9c9c8e8d8c643.mp4?t=1765566654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kabonk! is a nostalgic brick-breaker with multilevel puzzles, physic based controls and a sweet set of power ups set in neon-lit arcades. Enter the arcade and experience a classic with sparks, bounces and bonks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/c10289d9295587a5035a682c613268af.poster.avif?t=1765566654\" width=800 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/c10289d9295587a5035a682c613268af.webm?t=1765566654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/c10289d9295587a5035a682c613268af.mp4?t=1765566654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kabonk! you control a physics based paddle and navigate through multiple arcade levels by breaking bricks with different types of spheres, each with unique physics-based properties. Try smashing difficult bricks with more force or add spin-effects to reach difficult objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/49d08762e78fdca49a0021e43cf1e594.poster.avif?t=1765566654\" width=800 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/49d08762e78fdca49a0021e43cf1e594.webm?t=1765566654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/49d08762e78fdca49a0021e43cf1e594.mp4?t=1765566654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some bricks are unbreakable but some just needs some force or extra love. Manipulate your way through each level and try to beat each puzzle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ different worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ unique levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based manipulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon-lit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switches, buttons and pressure plates</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Crack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3628790/6d9440c0c537e75feed6736c1797d0ddef5a2cf4.jpg"},{"name":"Half-Mill Masher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3628790/55468c0a6a8ef8f851bb1ebf094f23ae7ef32007.jpg"},{"name":"Thousand Takedown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3628790/e5051800093e5e2bb8bd6064363acad4b99478a0.jpg"},{"name":"Blitz Breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3628790/4f2e2e92f4c5673ed3ae5d3a6799e59d94b1d0a1.jpg"},{"name":"Wall Wrecker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3628790/598970a3aead6320a3b2bb047fb214da35dd91b8.jpg"},{"name":"Epic Eraser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.s