:{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3699440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/8e93ca60da0ed86bc1e9c9c8e8d8c643.poster.avif?t=1765566654\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/8e93ca60da0ed86bc1e9c9c8e8d8c643.webm?t=1765566654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/8e93ca60da0ed86bc1e9c9c8e8d8c643.mp4?t=1765566654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kabonk! is a nostalgic brick-breaker with multilevel puzzles, physic based controls and a sweet set of power ups set in neon-lit arcades. Enter the arcade and experience a classic with sparks, bounces and bonks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/c10289d9295587a5035a682c613268af.poster.avif?t=1765566654\" width=800 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/c10289d9295587a5035a682c613268af.webm?t=1765566654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/c10289d9295587a5035a682c613268af.mp4?t=1765566654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kabonk! you control a physics based paddle and navigate through multiple arcade levels by breaking bricks with different types of spheres, each with unique physics-based properties. Try smashing difficult bricks with more force or add spin-effects to reach difficult objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/49d08762e78fdca49a0021e43cf1e594.poster.avif?t=1765566654\" width=800 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/49d08762e78fdca49a0021e43cf1e594.webm?t=1765566654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/49d08762e78fdca49a0021e43cf1e594.mp4?t=1765566654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some bricks are unbreakable but some just needs some force or extra love. Manipulate your way through each level and try to beat each puzzle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ different worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ unique levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based manipulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon-lit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switches, buttons and pressure plates</p></li></ul>","developers":["Spark of Chaos"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/d33b07e4239c66ca4b6f0fbe2eba7ce9d4b98e98/header.jpg?t=1765566654","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Kabonk! uses Unreal\u00ae Engine. Unreal\u00ae is a trademark or registered trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States of America and elsewhere. Unreal\u00ae Engine, Copyright 1998 - 2025, Epic Games, Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><